repository-code: https://github.com/tdruenen/WiSER-NL

abstract: >
  WiSER-NL supports the determination of wind statistics and
  effective roughness lengths for wind climate assessments in
  accordance with NEN 8100:2027. The software was developed at
  Eindhoven University of Technology as part of the NEN 8100
  revision working group.

keywords:
  - wind statistics
  - aerodynamic roughness length
  - wind comfort
  - wind danger
  - DOWA
  - NEN 8100
  - NPR 6097
  - CFD

